{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 0, "result": {"protocolVersion": "2025-06-18", "capabilities": {"tools": {"listChanged": false}, "resources": {}, "prompts": {}}, "serverInfo": {"name": "ucas", "title": "ucas, a computer algebra system for programmers", "version": "1"}, "instructions": "ucas analyses functions (exhaustively on machine types), does exact algebra and calculus, transforms, number theory and finite fields, and finds cheaper implementations, each answer checked or proved.  Expressions are ucas syntax strings; give parameters types (x: u8, x: f32, x: real) where it matters.  Definitions persist across calls.  An ambiguous input is an error listing its readings: retry with args.assume.KEY.  structuredContent holds the typed result, checks and proof."}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  x=0  ->  0\n  x=1  ->  0\n  x=2  ->  0\n  x=3  ->  1\n  x=4  ->  1\n  x=5  ->  1\n  x=6  ->  2\n  x=7  ->  2\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 1, "ok": true, "cmd": "table", "ucas": "it(x: u8 in 0..7) = x / 3\ntable it", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "table", "rows": [{"at": "x=0", "value": "0", "defined": true}, {"at": "x=1", "value": "0", "defined": true}, {"at": "x=2", "value": "0", "defined": true}, {"at": "x=3", "value": "1", "defined": true}, {"at": "x=4", "value": "1", "defined": true}, {"at": "x=5", "value": "1", "defined": true}, {"at": "x=6", "value": "2", "defined": true}, {"at": "x=7", "value": "2", "defined": true}], "truncated": false}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "  x=0  ->  0\n  x=1  ->  0\n  x=2  ->  0\n  x=3  ->  1\n  x=4  ->  1\n  x=5  ->  1\n  x=6  ->  2\n  x=7  ->  2\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "it and that are equal on the domain of it (exhaustive)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 2, "ok": true, "cmd": "equiv", "ucas": "it(x: i8) = (x/3)*3 + x%3\nthat(x: i8) = x\nequiv it that", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "equiv", "equal": true, "exhaustive": true, "mismatch_points": 0, "method": "exhaustive"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "proof": {"kind": "exhaustive", "text": "every point of the domain"}, "files": [], "text": "it and that are equal on the domain of it (exhaustive)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "range of it -> i8:\n  -128..127   (256 distinct values)\n  fits in i8\n  over all 256 points of the domain\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 3, "ok": true, "cmd": "range", "ucas": "it(x: i8) = x / -1\nrange it", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "range", "type": "i8", "empty": false, "exhaustive": true, "points": 256, "undefined_points": 0, "min": {"value": -128, "exact": "-128"}, "max": {"value": 127, "exact": "127"}, "distinct": 256, "fits": "i8"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "proof": {"kind": "exhaustive", "text": "every point of the domain evaluated"}, "files": [], "text": "range of it -> i8:\n  -128..127   (256 distinct values)\n  fits in i8\n  over all 256 points of the domain\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "domain of it:\n  x: u8, 0..255\n  y: u8, 0..3\n  requires y != 0  (in x/y)\n  defined at 768 of 1024 points\n  undefined e.g. at x=0, y=0; x=1, y=0; x=2, y=0; x=3, y=0\n  C undefined behaviour at 256 points, e.g. x=0, y=0\n  over all 1024 points of the domain\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 4, "ok": true, "cmd": "domain", "ucas": "it(x: u8, y: u8 in 0..3) = x / y\ndomain it", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "domain", "conditions": [{"kind": "requires", "text": "y != 0  (in x/y)"}], "defined_points": 768, "points": 1024, "exhaustive": true, "c_ub_points": 256, "undefined_example": "x=0, y=0; x=1, y=0; x=2, y=0; x=3, y=0", "c_ub_example": "x=0, y=0"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "domain of it:\n  x: u8, 0..255\n  y: u8, 0..3\n  requires y != 0  (in x/y)\n  defined at 768 of 1024 points\n  undefined e.g. at x=0, y=0; x=1, y=0; x=2, y=0; x=3, y=0\n  C undefined behaviour at 256 points, e.g. x=0, y=0\n  over all 1024 points of the domain\n"}, "isError": false}}
